ass the academy, only Welcome, the academy, the guide and your profile open.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="academy-quiz-rules-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Quiz rules (release 35)</h2><p class="gd-p">A quiz passes at 90%, opens after the reading time, lets you fix the questions marked wrong once, waits 2 minutes after a failed try and allows 10 tries a day. You get field jobs only once you have passed and hold a shift that day.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="academy-the-renter-s-side-and-ask-the-guide-first-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The renter&#39;s side and Ask the guide first (release 48)</h2><p class="gd-p">Your training now has the path <b class="gd-ui">The renter&#39;s side</b>: what the renter sees at each step, from the request to the deposit back, with each page of the renter guide (<b class="gd-ui">Renter guide</b>, at <span class="gd-url">/staff/guide/renter</span>). Your field path also has a section of worked examples from this guide: the ready check, the original licence, cash and add-ons.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">New staff take both from the start. Staff already working have 7 days: the academy page says the date; after it, the rest of the portal waits until they are passed.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Ask the guide first</b>: the Assistant panel names the guide chapter of the page you are on. Read it before you call the office.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
